WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:10.349
I've heard it called a death letter but
I don't know if that is the actual name

00:00:10.349 --> 00:00:17.960
I don't know if it has an actual name

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:29.640
but I do know what it is is something
that soldiers sometimes write when they

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:40.410
deploy in the harm's way then they put
it with your gear or in a footlocker

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:48.030
where it will be found or they give it
to a friend to pass on in case they die

00:00:48.030 --> 00:01:00.510
a letter to the family
they won't see again the mothers that

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:14.640
gave them life to father's that raised
them to wives that they left at home to

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:25.820
children they miss and in some cases to
the children they've never even met

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:42.179
it's a goodbye letter with a title
something like in case I don't come home

00:01:46.530 --> 00:02:00.549
well Jesse Givens rocked Springfield
Missouri wrote one of those letters he

00:02:00.549 --> 00:02:10.479
wrote it to his wife Melissa and their
son Dakota nicknamed toad and to their

00:02:10.479 --> 00:02:24.220
unborn son nicknamed bean who would
ultimately be named Carson and here is

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:39.220
what he said in that letter in case he
didn't come home my family I never

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:46.079
thought I would be writing a letter like
this I really don't know where to start

00:02:46.079 --> 00:02:57.579
I've been getting bad feelings though
and well if you're reading this I am

00:02:57.579 --> 00:03:05.200
forever in debt to you Dakota and the
bean I searched all my life for a dream

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:12.280
and I found it in you I would like to
think that I made a positive difference

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:25.810
in your lives I will never be able to
make up for the bad I am so sorry the

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:33.730
happiest moments in my life all deal
with my little family I will always have

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:42.530
with me the small moments we all shared
the moments when you quit taking life

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:52.640
seriously and smiled the cylons of a
beautiful boys laughter or the simple

00:03:52.640 --> 00:04:04.850
nudge of a baby unborn you will never
know how complete you have made me each

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:10.459
and every one of you you saved me from
loneliness and taught me how to think

00:04:10.459 --> 00:04:22.190
beyond myself you taught me how to live
and to love you open my eyes to a world

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:36.110
I never dreamed existed I am proud of
you stay on the path you choose never

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:49.370
lose sight of what is important you and
our babies Dakota you are more son than

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:59.260
I could ever ask for I can only hope I
was half the dad I used to be your Danny

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:05.990
but no matter what it makes me proud
that you chose me you taught me how to

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:11.960
care until it hurts you taught me how to
smile again you taught me that life

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:19.479
isn't so serious and sometimes you have
to play you have a big beautiful heart

00:05:19.479 --> 00:05:27.050
through life you need to keep it open
and follow it never be afraid to be

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:35.120
yourself I will always be there in our
Park when you dream so we can still play

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:47.960
I hope someday you will have a son like
mine make them smile and shine just like

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:50.350
you

00:05:50.889 --> 00:06:00.509
I love you code and I hope someday you
will understand why I didn't come home

00:06:00.779 --> 00:06:11.020
please be proud of me please don't stop
loving life take in every breath like

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:20.740
it's your first I love you code I will
always be there with you I'll be in the

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:28.979
Sun shadows dreams and joys of your life

00:06:32.039 --> 00:06:41.400
baby beam I never got to see you but I
know in my heart you are beautiful I

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:49.659
know you will be strong and big-hearted
just like your mom and brother I will

00:06:49.659 --> 00:06:55.900
always have with me the feel of the soft
nudges on your mom's belly and the joy I

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:59.800
felt when we found out you're on your
way

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:09.699
I dream of you every night I always will
don't ever think that since I wasn't

00:07:09.699 --> 00:07:16.029
around that I didn't love you you were
conceived of love and I came to this

00:07:16.029 --> 00:07:25.210
terrible place for love I love you as I
do your mom and brother with all my

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:31.960
heart and soul please understand that I
had to be gone so that I could take care

00:07:31.960 --> 00:07:39.599
of my family I love you being

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:50.240
I have never been so blessed as the day
I met Melissa you are my angel soulmate

00:07:50.240 --> 00:08:03.620
wife lover and best friend I am sorry I
did not want to have to write this

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:10.400
letter there is so much more I need to
say so much more I need to share a

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:21.080
lifetime's worth I married you for a
million lifetimes that's how long I will

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:31.070
be with you please keep our baby safe
please find it in your heart to forgive

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:40.070
me for leaving you alone take care of
yourself believe in yourself you are

00:08:40.070 --> 00:08:46.850
strong big-hearted woman teach our
babies to live life to its fullest and

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:55.870
tell yourself to do the same don't
forget to take toad to Disney World

00:08:55.870 --> 00:09:05.030
I'll be there with you Melissa I will
always want you need you and love you in

00:09:05.030 --> 00:09:21.170
my heart mind and soul do me a favor
after you tuck toad and beam in give

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:34.280
them hugs and kisses from me go outside
look at the stars and count them don't

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:43.870
forget to smile love always your husband
yes

00:09:50.380 --> 00:10:03.700
and Jesse didn't come home on May 1st
2003 Jesse Gibbons was killed while

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:10.750
conducting combat operations in Havana
Iraq when his Abrams tank plunged into

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:22.210
the fray DS River after the bank along
the river collapsed the three other crew

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:30.180
members made it out of the tank Jesse
did not

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:58.200
another brave warrior gone like so many
other warriors he left behind a family a

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:12.190
wife and children and a mother and
father and friends and life he left

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:21.100
behind everything every smile every
laugh every hug from his boys every kiss

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:29.790
from his wife everything going

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:45.570
and on this Memorial Day let us remember

00:11:47.610 --> 00:11:56.920
let us remember those soldiers sailors
airmen and Marines those brave warriors

00:11:56.920 --> 00:12:13.630
who for us for our freedom left
everything behind and after the Sun sets

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:32.400
on this Memorial Day and darkness
consumes the sky go outside and look up

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:46.050
and say thank you to those heroes that
now grace the heavens and then look at

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:57.630
the Stars
and count them and as much as your soul

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:08.279
aches with sadness as you mourn your
fallen family and friends and brothers

00:13:08.279 --> 00:13:18.750
in arms don't forget that they did not
sacrifice their lives for us to live in

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:21.680
that Ness

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:41.700
no they sacrificed their lives so we
could live in joy and happiness so even

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:56.390
on this most solemn day
Memorial Day don't forget for them

00:13:57.270 --> 00:14:00.170
to smile

